        <p>Batteries are complex systems, and key ideas like voltage limits, capacity balance, and aging are hard to build intuition for from equations alone.</p>
        <p>The two-tank model gives those relationships a physical picture. The tools and articles below turn that picture into something you can inspect, test, and use.</p>
